61
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,560
[SPEAKER_00] Volio bih da je malo.

62
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,680
[SPEAKER_02] Mogu biti stilniji.

63
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:31,839
